ABOUT THE UNIVERSITY

Medicaps University is one of the leading private universities in Central
India. Since its inception, the institution has consistently aimed at creating
an ideal ambience for budding technocrats and helps them to grow like
true professionals. We have an optimal blend of academic brilliance and
industry exposure. This has helped us in refining the candidature of our
graduating students from the engineering, management, agriculture,
commerce, science, pharmacy, arts, humanities and social sciences, law,
allied and healthcare, and journalism and mass communication field for the
last 26 years.

ABOUT THE FACULTY OF ENGINEERING

The Faculty of Engineering at Medicaps University offers a range of
undergraduate and postgraduate programs that are designed to equip
students with the skills and knowledge needed to succeed in the
competitive world of engineering.
Our undergraduate program includes B.Tech degrees in various
specializations. Our postgraduate program includes M.Tech degrees in
Computer Science and Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Mechanical
Engineering, Civil Engineering, Electronics and Communication,
Information Technology and integrated M.Tech in CSE. With a focus on
experiential learning and industry exposure, our programs provide students
with the opportunity to work on real-world projects and gain hands-on
experience in their field. Graduates from our programs have gone on to
excel in a range of industries, including IT, manufacturing, construction,
and telecommunications.
ABOUT THE INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE

IC4-2027 will be held in March 18-20, 2027 in Indore, Madhya Pradesh. This
IEEE International Conference will be a better platform for the researchers,
academicians and industry people to discuss and update the new changes
happening in the world.

Conference Objectives

  The conference theme converge different domains such as
  Computer, Communication and Control. This will boost the
  research in such a way by getting an opportunity for the
  researchers to discuss and reinvent the possibilities and new
  scopes which they can take up and prove themselves and
  contribute to the growth of our Nation
  There will be keynote address by eminent personalities in different
  domains of the conference theme that include Indian and foreign
  speakers.
  All the accepted and presented papers will be submitted for
  publication in IEEE Xplore (Conference Record #73190).

Conference Tracks

 Track 1: Computer Science and Engineering
 Track 2: Electronics and Communication
 Track 3: Information Technology
 Track 4: Instrumentation
 Track 5: Electrical Engineering
 Track 6: Robotics and Automation
